Name       : efl_negate
Auto-designing: Take n cliques, each built from exactly n vertices, where any two of the cliques share at most one vertex between them. Merge all of their vertices and edges into one graph. There is some arrangement of the n cliques whose merged graph cannot be colored with only n colors: every assignment of n colors to its vertices leaves at least one edge joining two vertices of the same color, so a valid coloring needs at least one color beyond n.

